====== TP-Link TL-SG2452P ======
~~NOTOC~~

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The TL-SG2452P, also known as T1600G-52PS, is a 48 (52) port Gigabit switch with PoE on all 48 RJ45 ports and 4 additional SFP ports.
Only v4 is supported by OpenWrt, the earlier versions are based on a Broadcom SoC and cannot be supported.

===== Non-working features =====

  * SFP ports: No support for the PHY at the moment
  * PoE: Additional workaround necessary to enable the ports (see below)
  * LEDs: Additional workaround necessary to enable the LEDs (see below)
  * Fan control: Only high and medium speed available, manual only

